[{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:sacrificial_knife","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"献祭小刀","titleEn":"Sacrificial Knife","rarity":"ultra","description":["当一名记者试图向奥托信徒众警告他的真实任务时，他割断了她的喉咙，作为对异议者的警告。","·暗夜生效时，离开储物柜会封锁16米范围内的所有翻越地点，持续5秒。"],"flavor":"“你们中间有内鬼！他们打算用黑暗的思想摧毁我们完美的家园。找到他们，把他们交给我！”——奥托·斯坦珀","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_sacrificialKnife.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Sacrificial_Knife","pinyin":"xianjixiaodao","initials":"xjxd"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:iridescent_wooden_plank","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"荧虹木板","titleEn":"Iridescent Wooden Plank","rarity":"ultra","description":["记者的血染红舞台木板后，一切都为影魔的到来做好了准备。","·逃生者在暗夜的最后12秒会受到危险状态影响。","危险状态会使逃生者受到普通攻击时直接陷入濒死状态。"],"flavor":"“她要用恐惧毒害你们的心灵！不要让恐惧进来！”——奥托·斯坦珀","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentWoodenPlank.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Wooden_Plank","pinyin":"yinghongmuban","initials":"yhmb"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:boat_key","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"小船钥匙","titleEn":"Boat Key","rarity":"very-rare","description":["只有一艘船允许人们进出该岛，而且钥匙被藏起来，以防止有人私下逃离。","·暗夜未生效时，传送速度增加16%。","·出口大门通电后，所有柜锁立刻被破坏。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_boatKey.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Boat_Key","pinyin":"xiaochuanyaoshi","initials":"xcys"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:field_recorder","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"现场记录仪","titleEn":"Field Recorder","rarity":"very-rare","description":["海蒂记录了她在重叠区附近的所有活动，不仅向世界，也向她自己证明她所看到的和感受到的。","· 比赛开始时暗夜即生效。","· 最后一台发电机修理完成后，暗夜自动生效。","· 接触遗骸的逃生者会受到疲劳状态影响，持续15秒。","疲劳状态会使逃生者无法激活疲劳相关技能。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_fieldRecorder.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Field_Recorder","pinyin":"xianchangjiluyi","initials":"xcjly"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:tilling_blade","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"耕作刀","titleEn":"Tilling Blade","rarity":"very-rare","description":["这座岛屿自给自足，信徒们在温暖的季节里翻耕坚硬的土壤，种植农作物。","·暗夜生效时，健康逃生者受伤后会受到障目、出血与重伤状态影响，持续80秒。","障目状态会使逃生者无法看到气场。","出血状态会使治疗进度在中断治疗后回退，并使受伤逃生者留下的血迹增加。该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。","重伤状态会使治疗所需时间增加25%，该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"“它就像捕食的猛兽一样，能嗅到并追踪鲜血。”","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tillingBlade.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Tilling_Blade","pinyin":"gengzuodao","initials":"gzd"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:lavalier_microphone","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"颈挂麦克风","titleEn":"Lavalier Microphone","rarity":"very-rare","description":["她在附近放了个颈挂麦克风，让她能在巨大压力下记录自己的内心感受。","· 使用最后一枚传送印记时显示逃生者气场，持续3秒。","· 使用传送进入储物柜时，所有逃生者6米范围内的其他储物柜都会打开并发出巨响。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_lavalierMicrophone.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Lavalier_Microphone","pinyin":"jingguamaikefeng","initials":"jgmkf"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:ottomarian_writing","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"奥托信徒众抄录","titleEn":"Ottomarian Writing","rarity":"rare","description":["奥托·斯坦珀的话语是信徒们唯一可阅读的话语，以此驱散那些恶念恶语。","· 暗夜未生效时，传送冷却时间减少2秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ottomarianWriting.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ottomarian_Writing","pinyin":"aotuoxintuzhongchaolu","initials":"atxtzcl"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:worry_stone","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"忘忧石","titleEn":"Worry Stone","rarity":"rare","description":["虽然奥托信徒众被要求只能有积极的想法，还是有些人会将这种石头放在口袋里，一旦有不好的想法出现就用手摩擦它们。","·逃生者对储物柜上锁时，其气场会显示6秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_worryStone.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Worry_Stone","pinyin":"wangyoushi","initials":"wys"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:war_helmet","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"战争头盔","titleEn":"War Helmet","rarity":"rare","description":["在调查阿尔卑斯山的某个重叠区时，她发现了一个废弃的战争地堡。在差点因重叠区而送命后，她从里面拿了个头盔。","·杀手本能持续时间延长1.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_warHelmet.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/War_Helmet","pinyin":"zhanzhengtoukui","initials":"zztk"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:broken_doll","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"损坏的人偶","titleEn":"Broken Doll","rarity":"rare","description":["信徒们带着自己的家人住在乌托邦中。没有人例外。","· 暗夜持续时间增加20秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_brokenDoll.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Broken_Doll","pinyin":"sunhuaiderenou","initials":"shdro"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:destroyed_pillow","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"被毁的枕头","titleEn":"Destroyed Pillow","rarity":"rare","description":["发布睡眠禁令后，奥托信徒众中的头领还要将寝具全部毁掉，避免恶念者偷偷打盹。","·暗夜生效时，传送冷却时间减少2.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_destroyedPillow.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Destroyed_Pillow","pinyin":"beihuidezhentou","initials":"bhdzt"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:malthinker_s_skull","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"恶念者的头骨","titleEn":"Malthinker's Skull","rarity":"uncommon","description":["那些给社区带来负面情绪的人，会时不时地神秘消失。 他们的尸体从未被发现……直到影魔出现。","·有受伤逃生者时，暗夜充能速度增加25%。"],"flavor":"那些给社区带来负面情绪的人，会时不时地神秘消失。 他们的尸体从未被发现……直到影魔出现。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_malthinkersSkull.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Malthinker%27s_Skull","pinyin":"enianzhedetougu","initials":"enzdtg"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:fallen_shingle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"掉落的瓦片","titleEn":"Fallen Shingle","rarity":"uncommon","description":["在奥托信徒众被影魔吞噬后，这座宅邸便无人维护了。","·使用黑暗统治会使暗夜充能速度额外增加15%/秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_fallenShingle.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Fallen_Shingle","pinyin":"diaoluodewapian","initials":"dldwp"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:haddie_s_calendar","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"海蒂的日历","titleEn":"Haddie's Calendar","rarity":"uncommon","description":["她计划在父母带她去印度前每天都划掉日期，但当悲剧发生后，她把日历丢掉了。","· 离开上锁储物柜所需时间减少0.4秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_haddiesCalendar.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Haddie%27s_Calendar","pinyin":"haididerili","initials":"hddrl"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:burnt_letters","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"烧毁的信件","titleEn":"Burnt Letters","rarity":"uncommon","description":["有些信徒想写信回家。斯坦珀确保没有人能够与外界联系。","· 每次伤害逃生者时获得的暗夜充能增加25%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_burntLetters.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Burnt_Letters","pinyin":"shaohuidexinjian","initials":"shdxj"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:air_freshener","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"空气清新剂","titleEn":"Air Freshener","rarity":"uncommon","description":["她的父母被找到后，这东西在警察归还的财物袋中。海蒂不知道自己为什么要保留它。","·增加1枚力量印记用于传送。"],"flavor":"她的父母被找到后，这东西在警察归还的财物袋中。海蒂不知道自己为什么要保留它。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_airFreshener.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Air_Freshener","pinyin":"kongqiqingxinji","initials":"kqqxj"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:follower_s_cowl","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"信徒风帽","titleEn":"Follower's Cowl","rarity":"common","description":["他们认为风帽代表了他们的启蒙，但实际上这东西只能让他们处于黑暗之中。","·即使暗夜未生效时，传送至遗骸仍会激活杀手本能。"],"flavor":"他们认为风帽代表了他们的启蒙，但实际上这东西只能让他们处于黑暗之中。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_followersCowl.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Follower%27s_Cowl","pinyin":"xintufengmao","initials":"xtfm"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:caffeine_tablets","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"咖啡因药片","titleEn":"Caffeine Tablets","rarity":"common","description":["斯坦珀的信徒们被告知不要睡觉，否则他们会招致德鲁安尼的怒火。临近结束时，他掏出了来自大陆的药品。","·蓄力日暮与传送时，上锁储物柜的气场显示为黄色。"],"flavor":"斯坦珀的信徒们被告知不要睡觉，否则他们会招致德鲁安尼的怒火。临近结束时，他掏出了来自大陆的药品。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_caffeineTablets.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Caffeine_Tablets","pinyin":"kafeiyinyaopian","initials":"kfyyp"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:wooden_plank","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"木板","titleEn":"Wooden Plank","rarity":"common","description":["一块从舞台上撕下的木板，奥托·斯坦珀在那里献祭了一名爱管闲事的记者。","·每次钩住逃生者时获得的暗夜充能增加25%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_woodenPlank.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Wooden_Plank","pinyin":"muban","initials":"mb"},{"id":"addon:reign_of_darkness:mortar_and_pestle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-28","title":"研钵&研杵","titleEn":"Mortar and Pestle","rarity":"common","description":["由于与世界和现代医学脱节，斯坦珀的信徒们最初不得不利用岛上的当地植物来进行治疗。","· 影魔在遗骸上重新出现时，会面对传送激活时的方向，而非遗骸本身面对的方向。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_mortarAndPestle.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Mortar_and_Pestle","pinyin":"yanboyanchu","initials":"ybyc"}]
